<div class="a11y-intro">
  <h1>Thanks for your interest in the PDF Accessibility Toolkit For Graphic Designers</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 2.3rem; margin: 0 0 50px;">Here are your resources!</p>


  <p style="font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 50px;">Note: The Google Sheets and Docs versions will ask you to make your own copy of the file. This means you will have a copy that belongs to you and can be edited freely without changing the original version.</p>
