                        <img src="/images/a11y/thumb_a11y-checklist.png" alt="" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="project-card__body">
                    <h2>PDF Accessibility Project Checklist</h2>
                    <p>An editable project checklist for creating accessible PDFs in InDesign.</p>
                    <div class="a11y-download-row">
                        <span class="project-card__eyebrow">Google Sheets</span>
                        <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YXkH2XNP0VOWK6FODQDQgAb42eAjL8bHyoohmABwoXo/copy?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span class="copy-link">Save a copy</span></a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              </article>

              <article class="project-card project-card--small">
                  <div class="project-card__thumb">
                        <img src="/images/a11y/thumb_a11y-reference.png" alt="" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="project-card__body">
                    <h2>PDF Accessibility Quick Reference</h2>
                    <p>A condensed reference of accessibility checks. Use the printable version designed to sit beside your monitor or reference while you work, or the Google Doc for a quick digital checklist.</p>
                    <div class="a11y-download-row">
                        <span class="project-card__eyebrow">Printable PDF</span>
                        <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OLqUfB4bVFHD91d7sw5CbhfaX5eJkjgF/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span class="download-link">Download</span></a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="a11y-download-row">
                        <span class="project-card__eyebrow">Google Docs</span>
                        <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nvLA5b17P5xWFUKmpv2ZoruyljwZ4DVEGCA1g-XBCmI/copy?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span class="copy-link">Save a copy</span></a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              </article>

              <article class="project-card project-card--small">
                  <div class="project-card__thumb">
                        <img src="/images/a11y/thumb_a11y-alt-text.png" alt="" />
