                  <div class="project-card__body">
                    <h2>Alt Text Tracker</h2>
                    <p>An editable tracker for drafting alt text for images in your document.</p>
                    <div class="a11y-download-row">
                        <span class="project-card__eyebrow">Google Docs</span>
                        <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lHrwPC_ujwXgo42kOSYAntrcb4sHBhJDT3c-sHdGTMc/copy?usp=sharing" target="_blank"><span class="copy-link">Save a copy</span></a>
